<title>USA: Novellus acquires Varian assets.</title>
<headline>Novellus acquires Varian assets.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novellus Systems Inc said Monday it has completed the acquisition of the thin films systems business of Varian Associates Inc.</p>
<p>Novellus said in a statement it paid about $150 million in cash. The acquisition offers the potential to nearly double Novellus' served available market, the company said.</p>
</text>
